Description: Declarative nftables configuration with live reconcile
 nftconf reconciles a small declarative config language against the live
 nftables ruleset. It supports NAT, whitelist/shield INPUT policy, multi-NIC
 address contexts, a file-watching daemon with pidfile, and conversion to
 consolidated nftables.d snippets.
 .
 Documentation is built with AsciiDoctor (man) and AsciiDoctor→DocBook→Texinfo
 (info). A Docker Compose demo lab lives under demo/.
